\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 California governor\u8217\'20\'19s ad campaign offers help to women in anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  states\b0\par\par\uc2 Lois Beckett \par \uc2 685 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 September 2022\par 19:46 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Billboards will be displayed in states including Texas, Mississippi and Ohio but have some questioning \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ambitions\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNeed an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ? California is ready to help.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s one of the billboard advertisements that California\u8217\'20\'19s governor, \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 , is paying to display across seven of America\u8217\'20\'19s most aggressively anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  states, including Texas, Mississippi, Ohio, South Carolina and South Dakota.\par \par \uc2 The advertising blitz in states outside California is being funded by Newsom\u8217\'20\'19s re-election campaign for governor \u8211\'20\'13 Newsom is expected to easily win re-election in November in his deep blue state. But the move is renewing questions about the Democratic politician\u8217\'20\'19s national ambitions.\par \par \uc2 A recent poll found that the majority of California voters {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://escholarship.org/uc/item/0zf87045"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 do not think}}}\uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  should run for re-election in 2024, and that Newsom was one of the leading contenders to replace him.\par \par \uc2 The California governor has repeatedly denied having any interest in running for president, while simultaneously paying for high-profile {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GavinNewsom/status/1543610674873438208"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ad campaigns}}}\uc2  in states outside the one in which he is running for office. In July, he launched a television {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://calmatters.org/newsletters/whatmatters/2022/07/mass-shooting-california-gun-laws/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ad campaign in Florida}}}\uc2 , where the Republican governor, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , is considered a leading replacement for Trump in the 2024 Republican presidential race, focused on the state\u8217\'20\'19s attacks against LBGTQ+ people, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/apr/22/florida-examples-prohibited-topics-math-textbooks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 book bans}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/17/florida-pregnant-teenager-abortion-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  restrictions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This week, Newsom also asked the US attorney general to investigate the governors of Texas and Florida for transporting migrants across the country to wealthy Democratic enclaves such as Washington DC, and Martha\u8217\'20\'19s Vineyard, in what has widely been criticised as a political stunt.\par \par \uc2 What {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovRonDeSantis?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @GovRonDeSantis}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GregAbbott_TX?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @GregAbbott_TX}}}\uc2  are doing isn\u8217\'20\'19t clever, it\u8217\'20\'19s cruel.\par \par \uc2 I\u8217\'20\'19m formally requesting the DOJ begin an immediate investigation into these inhumane efforts to use kids as political pawns. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/x2sBa06nSw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/x2sBa06nSw}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  (@GavinNewsom) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GavinNewsom/status/1570494973241610240?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 15, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The messaging in many of Newsom\u8217\'20\'19s new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ads is sharply critical of Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 successful efforts to ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with phrases like, \u8220\'20\'1CTexas does not own your body. You do,\u8221\'20\'1D and an image of a woman with her hands cuffed behind her back.\par \par \uc2 The 18 billboards point viewers to a new California state-funded website, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gov.ca.gov/2022/09/13/california-launches-abortion-ca-gov/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 .ca.gov}}}\uc2 , which offers guidance on how people outside California can access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care in the state, an effort that Planned Parenthood\u8217\'20\'19s California affiliate praised as a good model for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gov.ca.gov/2022/09/13/california-launches-abortion-ca-gov/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  access}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHere is my message to any woman seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care in these anti-freedom states: come to California,\u8221\'20\'1D Newsom said in a statement announcing the campaign, saying that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans \u8220\'20\'1Care literally killing women\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 On his personal \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account, Newsom launched the ad campaign by tagging seven anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Republican governors in tweets showing images of the billboards.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe people of Mississippi deserve to know they have access to the care you are refusing to provide. This will be launching in your state today,\u8221\'20\'1D he told the Mississippi governor, \uc2 Tate Reeves\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/tatereeves?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @tatereeves}}}\uc2  the people of Mississippi deserve to know they have access to the care you are refusing to provide. This will be launching in your state today. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/8qg7psYT2j"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/8qg7psYT2j}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  (@GavinNewsom) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GavinNewsom/status/1570457823997497350?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 15, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The Newsom campaign noted that it expects the Mississippi billboards could face a legal challenge in the state. A spokesperson for Reeves told the \uc2 Washington Post\uc2  that it was \u8220\'20\'1Cinteresting to see Governor Newsom\u8217\'20\'19s 2024 primary campaign extend to Mississippi\u8221\'20\'1D and that they thought most residents \u8220\'20\'1Cwill not be interested in what he\u8217\'20\'19s selling\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Newsom himself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2022/09/15/gavin-newsome-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Washington Post }}}\uc2  that he had launched the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ad campaign \u8220\'20\'1Cbecause the people that support my candidacy support this. And when many heard about this, they wanted to support additional efforts like it, to be fully transparent with you.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Polls show that Newsom is expected to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/california/story/2022-08-23/new-polls-finds-that-newsom-dominates-governors-race-despite-voter-concerns-over-the-trajectory-of-the-state"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cruise to victory}}}\uc2  over his little-known Republican opponent in the California governor\u8217\'20\'19s race this November, after triumphing over an expensive attempt to recall him as governor in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220916ei9g0038q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
