\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Republican \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  proposes nationwide 15-week  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe and Chris Stein \par \uc2 860 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 September 2022\par 14:19 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 30\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 White House says South Carolina senator\u8217\'20\'19s proposed bill \u8216\'20\'18wildly out of step with what Americans believe\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Senator \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  proposed legislation on Tuesday for a nationwide 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, a politically risky strategy as a backlash grows to the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruling earlier this summer overturning federal protections for the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Polling shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/fact-tank/2022/07/15/key-facts-about-the-abortion-debate-in-america/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 57% of Americans disapproved}}}\uc2  of the court\u8217\'20\'19s June {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reversal of the 1973 Roe v Wade ruling}}}\uc2  guaranteeing access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and 62% say the procedure should be legal in all or most cases.\par \par \uc2 The proposal by Graham, a hardline South Carolina Republican, will be called the \u8220\'20\'1CProtecting Pain-capable Unborn Children from Late-term Abortions Act\u8221\'20\'1D. It stands almost no chance of becoming law, but is seen by analysts as an attempt to frame the discussion around \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with fewer than 60 days until the midterms.\par \par \uc2 The White House and top Democrats promptly decried Graham\u8217\'20\'19s efforts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday, Senator Graham introduced a national ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  which would strip away women\u8217\'20\'19s rights in all 50 states. This bill is wildly out of step with what Americans believe,\u8221\'20\'1D the White House press secretary, \uc2 Karine Jean-Pierre\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2022/09/13/statement-by-press-secretary-karine-jean-pierre-on-proposed-national-abortion-ban/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in a statement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 She added: \u8220\'20\'1CWhile President Biden and Vice-President Harris are focused on the historic passage of the Inflation Reduction Act to reduce the cost of prescription drugs, health care, and energy \u8211\'20\'13 and to take unprecedented action to address climate change \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/republicans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Republicans}}}\uc2  in Congress are focused on taking rights away from millions of women.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She said the Biden administration and Democrats in Congress \u8220\'20\'1Care committed to restoring the protections of Roe v Wade\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Republicans in states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/09/south-carolina-republicans-democrats-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including South Carolina}}}\uc2  have seen recent efforts to introduce \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans falter, and Democrats are certain to use Graham\u8217\'20\'19s push to fire up their base and repeat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/abortion-health-mitch-mcconnell-government-and-politics-3cf10d1e1b3dc46ea202a466a86ae9ea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earlier warnings}}}\uc2  that their opponents\u8217\'20\'19 agenda has always been the pursuit of outlawing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lgraham.senate.gov/public/index.cfm/2021/1/graham-reintroduces-20-week-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Previous versions of Graham\u8217\'20\'19s bill}}}\uc2  have outlawed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 20 weeks of pregnancy, but at a press conference on Tuesday he was unveiling a proposed ban that takes effect after 15 weeks, an attempt to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/09/florida-abortion-ban-ron-desantis-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 align federal law with Florida}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Graham\u8217\'20\'19s earlier proposals contained exceptions for rape, incest, and to protect the life of the mother, which the Florida law does not.\par \par \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2  added to her party\u8217\'20\'19s protests, calling Graham\u8217\'20\'19s proposal \u8220\'20\'1Cthe latest, clearest signal of extreme Maga Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 intent to criminalize women\u8217\'20\'19s health freedom in all 50 states and arrest doctors for providing basic care.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  has recently toughened his language, as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/11/kamala-harris-midterm-elections-voting-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 midterm elections approach}}}\uc2  and Republicans put forward many rightwing candidates, decrying so-called Maga Republicansas {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/26/biden-trump-republicans-fascism-speech-maryland"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 semi-fascis}}}\uc2  t and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/05/joe-biden-labor-day-speech-wisconsin-unions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTrumpies\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Pelosi added: \u8220\'20\'1CMake no mistake: if Republicans get the chance, they will work to pass laws even more draconian than this bill \u8211\'20\'13 just like the bans they have enacted in states like Texas, Mississippi and Oklahoma.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Even if Republicans seize control of the Senate chamber in November, Graham\u8217\'20\'19s bill is unlikely to pass because the current Senate minority leader, \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2 , has indicated he would be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/may/11/mitch-mcconnell-senate-republicans-could-not-pass-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unwilling to lift the filibuster}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 a procedure that requires a bill to win the support of 60 senators \u8211\'20\'13 for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  issue.\par \par \uc2 McConnell, and Republicans generally, have taken note of developments since the fall of Roe v Wade. While nine Republican-controlled states moved quickly to enact \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans, others have witnessed a significant backlash.\par \par \uc2 In Kansas, a staunchly conservative state, voters last month {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/12/how-abortion-rights-won-kansas-strategies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rejected \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  restrictions}}}\uc2  by a large margin, and pro-choice advocates recorded a notable victory earlier this month when the Michigan supreme court ruled 5-2 that the fate of an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban would be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2022/09/08/michigan-supreme-court-puts-abortion-on-november-ballot-00055774"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in the hands of the midterms electorate}}}\uc2  rather than the state legislature.\par \par \uc2 Democratic candidates have seized on the apparent momentum. In Pennsylvania, Senate hopeful \uc2 John Fetterman{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/12/john-fetterman-pennsylvania-rally-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told a weekend rally}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights were at the top of his agenda. \u8220\'20\'1CWomen are the reason we can win. Don\u8217\'20\'19t piss off women,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 According to research by TargetSmart, a polling analysis company, Pennsylvania ranks fifth in states showing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/tbonier/status/1559897880042868736"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large gaps in registration numbers between men and women}}}\uc2  since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Increasing numbers of Republican candidates running for election in November\u8217\'20\'19s midterms, meanwhile, have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/12/republicans-soften-staunch-anti-abortion-stance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 softening their messaging }}}\uc2  over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an attempt to shore up votes, though GOP lawmakers have no plans to soften anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.\par \par \uc2 Marjorie Dannenfelser, president of the Susan B Anthony Pro-Life America group that is promoting Graham\u8217\'20\'19s legislation, said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://sbaprolife.org/newsroom/press-releases/100-state-pro-life-leaders-urge-congress-take-action-to-protect-unborn-children-mothers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a statement}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cradical Democrats [are] pushing an extreme agenda of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  on demand until birth, paid for by the taxpayer, leaving countless unborn babies and mothers unprotected from the violence of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She called on Congress to \u8220\'20\'1Cfind consensus on a minimum federal standard that reflects the values of the overwhelming majority of Americans\u8221\'20\'1D, citing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://harvardharrispoll.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/HHP_June2022_KeyResults.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harvard Harris poll}}}\uc2  from June that suggested 79% of Americans wanted abortions limited to 15 weeks.\par \par \uc2 The same poll, however, also found that 55% opposed the overturning of Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220913ei9d002eb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
