\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Indiana investigates  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  doctor who treated 10-year-old rape victim\b0\par\par\uc2 Maya Yang \par \uc2 767 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2022\par 21:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 State attorney general notifies Dr Caitlin Bernard and claims \u8216\'20\'18she used a 10-year-old girl to push her political ideology\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 The Indiana state attorney general has launched an investigation into the doctor who performed an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jul/03/ohio-indiana-abortion-rape-victim"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10-year-old rape victim}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 According to Kathleen DeLaney, a lawyer acting for the doctor, Caitlin Bernard, a notice from the Indiana attorney general, Todd Rokita, regarding his investigation arrived on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are in the process of reviewing this information. It\u8217\'20\'19s unclear to us what is the nature of the investigation and what authority he has to investigate Dr Bernard,\u8221\'20\'1D DeLaney {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/2022/07/27/us/indiana-doctor-child-rape-abortion-ag-investigation/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  told}}}\uc2  CNN. The Guardian has contacted DeLaney for additional comments.\par \par \uc2 On 2 July, Bernard reported a 30 June medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for her 10-year-old patient, who had been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jul/03/ohio-indiana-abortion-rape-victim"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 obliged to travel}}}\uc2  to the state from Ohio, after that state followed the US {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s overturning}}}\uc2  a few days earlier of the federal right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and banned the procedure after six weeks of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 According to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jul/15/doctor-10-year-old-rape-victim-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2  reviewed by the Indianapolis Star and WXIN-TV of Indianapolis, Bernard\u8217\'20\'19s reporting of her treatment to the health authorities came within the three-day requirement set by state law for individuals aged below 16 who undergo an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The reports added that the patient who sought the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  had become pregnant as the result of sexual abuse.\par \par \uc2 A 27-year-old man has since been charged in Columbus, Ohio, in connection with abuse of the girl.\par \par \uc2 Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bernard became the center of a political firestorm from rightwing media outlets and Republican politicians after \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  expressed sympathy for the girl when he signed an executive order earlier this month aimed at safeguarding \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access after the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 action in upending}}}\uc2  the historic 1973 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 According to DeLaney, Bernard is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jul/15/doctor-10-year-old-rape-victim-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considering}}}\uc2  taking legal action against \u8220\'20\'1Cthose who have smeared my client\u8221\'20\'1D, including Rokita, who previously said that he would investigate whether she violated \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  reporting or child abuse notification laws.\par \par \uc2 In a statement to the Guardian on Wednesday, Rokita said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe baseless defamation claim and other accusations are really just attempts to distract, intimidate and obstruct my office\u8217\'20\'19s monumental progress to save lives. It will take a lot more than that to intimidate us.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe doctor alone brought this case to the press. She used a 10-year-old girl \u8211\'20\'13 a child rape victim\u8217\'20\'19s personal trauma \u8211\'20\'13 to push her political ideology. She was aided and abetted by a fake news media who conveniently misquoted my words to try to give abortionists and their readership numbers an extra boost.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Rokita added: \u8220\'20\'1CMy heart breaks for this little girl.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.indystar.com/story/news/health/2022/07/15/iu-health-says-indiana-doctor-did-not-violate-hipaa-laws-in-10-year-old-abortion-case/65374295007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According to}}}\uc2 Indiana University Health\uc2 , where Bernard practices as an obstetrician-gynecologist, \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 IU Health\uc2  conducted an investigation with the full cooperation of Dr Bernard and other \uc2 IU Health\uc2  team members. \uc2 IU Health\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s investigation found Dr Bernard in compliance with privacy laws.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Pregnancy termination forms that Bernard filed with the Indiana department of health, which Indy Star obtained and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.indystar.com/story/news/health/2022/07/14/ohio-abortion-10-year-old-indiana-todd-rokita-dr-caitlin-bernard/65373626007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reviewed}}}\uc2 , showed that Bernard indicated the girl was six weeks pregnant at the time of her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that Bernard did not know the age of the person who impregnated her.\par \par \uc2 Bernard\u8217\'20\'19s attorney {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jul/15/doctor-10-year-old-rape-victim-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that she \u8220\'20\'1Ctook every appropriate and proper action in accordance with the law and both her medical and ethical training as a physician\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, a Wyoming judge on Wednesday temporarily blocked that state\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban on the day it took effect, siding with a firebombed women\u8217\'20\'19s health clinic and others who argued the ban would violate the state constitution and harm healthcare workers and their patients.\par \par \uc2 And lawmakers in West Virginia debated an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, drawing an at times raucous crowd of hundreds to the state capitol, where dozens spoke against the bill on the house floor.\par \par \uc2 Wyoming\u8217\'20\'19s court action puts it among several states including Kentucky, Louisiana and Utah where judges temporarily blocked implementation of \u8220\'20\'1Ctrigger laws\u8221\'20\'1D while lawsuits play out. On Friday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wbrz.com/news/louisiana-can-enforce-abortion-ban-while-legal-battle-plays-out-in-court/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Louisiana appellate court allowed}}}\uc2  the state to enforce its \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban while a lawsuit challenging it played out.\par \par \uc2 Such trigger laws are designed to automatically implement pre-prepared \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban laws after Roe was felled and the power over the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was returned from the federal government to the states.\par \par \uc2 Later on Wednesday, a North Dakota judge blocked a trigger law there that was set to outlaw \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state starting on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The Associated Press contributed reporting\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220727ei7r003h1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
