\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Teen bullied by Matt Gaetz raises over $200,000 for  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights funds\b0\par\par\uc2 Gloria Oladipo in New York \par \uc2 539 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2022\par 17:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Olivia Julianna credits Republican for bringing attention to her platform after he \u8216\'20\'18decided to body shame me publicly\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 A Texas teenager has raised more than $200,000 for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jul/27/abortion-rights-groups-step-up-digital-game-to-reach-people-online-post-roe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights}}}\uc2  funds, after being bullied online by the Florida Republican congressman Matt Gaetz.\par \par \uc2 Olivia Julianna, 19, said that by Wednesday she had raised $214,000 for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds, a sum she credited to Gaetz bringing attention to her platform via his insults.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMatt Gaetz decided to body shame me publicly,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1552125690220355586?s=20&t=R6VNIi53r6qzn5hRUna44g"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights activist}}}\uc2  tweeted on Tuesday. \u8220\'20\'1CSo I started fundraising for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds and in a little over 24 hours we raised $115K. So let me have one final moment of telling [Gaetz] not to fuck with Texas activist[s], and definitely not to fuck with Gen-Z.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, Julianna {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1552309785525198849?s=20&t=b2b0LSZ1kWZC00fHZr9PMQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  that the campaign had raised nearly double its Tuesday total.\par \par \uc2 She told the Guardian: \u8220\'20\'1COriginally I wanted to raise a few thousand dollars. I had no idea it would blow up as much as it has.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month, stoking protests across the country.\par \par \uc2 Last Saturday, at a Turning Point USA convention in Florida, Gaetz insulted \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights activists, telling a crowd of students pro-choice campaigners were \u8220\'20\'1Codious from the inside out\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cdisgusting\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Julianna {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1551271014809608192?s=20&t=NydIzdzpFCUEPJrawKuXKw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criticized the comments on Twitter}}}\uc2 , referencing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vanityfair.com/news/2022/07/matt-gaetz-marc-short-sex-trafficking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allegations}}}\uc2  of sex trafficking a minor for which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/aug/22/matt-gaetz-republican-sex-trafficking-investigation-marries-california"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gaetz is under investigation}}}\uc2 . He emphatically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2022/01/27/sex-trafficking-allegations-matt-gaetz/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denies}}}\uc2  wrongdoing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIts come to my attention that Matt Gaetz \u8230\'20\'26 has said that it\u8217\'20\'19s always the \u8216\'20\'18odious 5\u8217\'20\'192 350 pound\u8217\'20\'19 women that \u8216\'20\'18nobody wants to impregnate\u8217\'20\'19 who rally for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Julianna wrote. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m actually 5\u8217\'20\'1911. 6\u8217\'20\'194 in heels. I wear them so the small men like you are reminded of your place.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gaetz then tweeted out a picture of Julianna alongside an article covering his comments, an insult retweeted hundreds of times.\par \par \uc2 Of Gaetz\u8217\'20\'19s tweet, Julianna said: \u8220\'20\'1CI was shocked. I was truly shocked that he would do something so absolutely stupid.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In response to the congressman\u8217\'20\'19s comments and the online {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1551732767049801729?s=20&t=-NJvCezl-ATC7aKQ6-_Xcg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 harassment}}}\uc2  they stoked, Julianna announced on Monday that she would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1551742930301378567?s=20&t=b2b0LSZ1kWZC00fHZr9PMQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raise money for \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  funds }}}\uc2  on behalf of the organization Gen Z for Change.\par \par \uc2 She said she was motivated to begin her fundraiser because \u8220\'20\'1CMatt Gaetz is a creep and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is healthcare. Simple as that\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna/status/1552036451218513921/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a thank you note }}}\uc2  to Gaetz on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , the teen wrote, in part: \u8220\'20\'1CYour hateful comments towards me will quite literally help pay for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services. Lol. Get rekt.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gaetz has not responded publicly to Julianna\u8217\'20\'19s fundraising efforts but he has doubled down on his comments, calling pro-choice activists \u8220\'20\'1Cugly and overweight\u8221\'20\'1D in an interview with WEAR ABC 3, a Florida news station.\par \par \uc2 Joel Valdez, Gaetz\u8217\'20\'19s communications director, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.today.com/parents/teens/matt-gaetz-teen-body-shamed-abortion-funds-rcna40045"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented to Today Parents}}}\uc2 , writing: \u8220\'20\'1CCongressman Gaetz\u8217\'20\'19s speech speaks for itself.\u8221\'20\'1D Valdez also shared the followup interview, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CHe provided further comment here.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s probably afraid,\u8221\'20\'1D said Julianna, referring to Gaetz not replying to her comments or campaign. \u8220\'20\'1CLast time \u8216\'20\'18Matt Gaetz\u8217\'20\'19 and \u8216\'20\'18teenager\u8217\'20\'19 were trending it didn\u8217\'20\'19t exactly go well for him.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220727ei7r002uz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
