\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 The right denied the story of a 10-year-old getting an  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 it only gets worse\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,272 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2022\par 14:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal called the horrifying ordeal \u8216\'20\'18too good to confirm\u8217\'20\'19, but no apologies came when a 27-year-old was arrested for the crime\par \par \uc2 The right think a child being raped is \u8216\'20\'18too good to confirm\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a sentence nobody should ever have to write: a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jul/14/man-charged-10-year-old-abortion-rightwing-media-indiana-ohio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 10-year-old Ohio girl}}}\uc2  was raped and then had to flee her state in order to have a safe and legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Instead of reacting with horror, Republican politicians and the rightwing media\u8217\'20\'19s first instinct was to claim the story, first published by the Indianapolis Star on July 1, was fake news. On Monday, for example, Ohio attorney general \uc2 Dave Yost{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dispatch.com/story/news/2022/07/13/ohio-attorney-general-rejoices-arrest-child-rape-suspect/10048250002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Fox News}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1CEvery day that goes by the more likely that this [story] is a fabrication \u8230\'20\'26 shame on the Indianapolis paper that ran this thing on a single source who has an obvious axe to grind.\u8221\'20\'1D Fox News host \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2  called the incident \u8220\'20\'1Cnot true\u8221\'20\'1D and his colleague Jesse Watters suggested {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/fox-news-host-jesse-watters-suggested-10-year-old-rape-victims-abortion-was-a-hoax-before-arrest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it was a hoax}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It wasn\u8217\'20\'19t just rightwingers who doubted the veracity of the story: corners of the mainstream media also rushed to question it. The Wall Street Journal published an article from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/an-abortion-story-too-good-to-confirm-joe-biden-ten-year-old-girl-indiana-ohio-caitlin-bernard-11657648618"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its editorial board}}}\uc2  with the headline: \u8220\'20\'1CAn \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Story Too Good to Confirm\u8221\'20\'1D. Too good to confirm. They used those words to describe a 10-year-old being raped and not being able to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in her home state of Ohio, which has banned abortions after six weeks, with no exceptions for rape and incest. Too good to confirm!\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Washington Post\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Glenn Kessler also heavily insinuated that the story was made up by anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists in a \u8216\'20\'18fact-checking\u8217\'20\'19 column headlined \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2022/07/09/one-source-story-about-10-year-old-an-abortion-goes-viral/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A one-source story about a 10-year-old and an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  goes viral}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D Kessler took issue with the fact that the Indianapolis Star only cited one source for the story about the 10-year-old: an obstetrician-gynecologist called Caitlin Bernard, who goes on the record. Adding to Kessler\u8217\'20\'19s seeming cynicism about the incident is the fact, he writes, that \u8220\'20\'1Can \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  of a 10-year-old is pretty rare\u8221\'20\'1D. In the very next sentence, however, he notes that \u8220\'20\'1CThe Columbus Dispatch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dispatch.com/story/news/2022/07/06/10-year-old-ohio-abortion-among-minors-declining/7819510001/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that in 2020, 52 people under the age of 15 received an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Ohio.\u8221\'20\'1D That is ONCE A WEEK. How on earth can that be considered \u8220\'20\'1Crare\u8221\'20\'1D? (Kessler later said on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  that he regretted using the word \u8220\'20\'1Crare.\u8221\'20\'1D)\par \par \uc2 It would have been far better if the horrific story had been a hoax rather than a vulnerable young child\u8217\'20\'19s reality. But, on Wednesday, a 27-year-old man was charged with the rape. Did all the naysayers apologize? Of course not. Fox News shrugged their shoulders and moved on. Kessler, meanwhile, responded to criticism of his column with a snarky tweet. \u8220\'20\'1CThe last line of this fact check was: \u8216\'20\'18If a rapist is ever charged, the fact finally would have more solid grounding,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GlennKesslerWP/status/1547277419517825027?s=20&t=q3l6oswq1PiX43wMrFZtyg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kessler wrote}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CNow, a rapist has been charged and the story has been updated. Getting lots of angry emails but journalism is an accumulation of facts.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Here are a few facts for you: as Kessler\u8217\'20\'19s own newspaper has reported, less than a third of rape incidents are reported to the police; only 5.7% of rape cases lead to an arrest; and less than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2018/10/06/less-than-percent-rapes-lead-felony-convictions-least-percent-victims-face-emotional-physical-consequences/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1% of rapes lead to felony convictions}}}\uc2 . One major reason so few sexual assault cases are reported to the authorities is because victims are afraid that unless the whole incident was caught on high-definition video and witnessed by the Pope, they will not be believed. And even if they are believed, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely that they\u8217\'20\'19ll somehow be blamed for the incident. Their skirt was too short! They shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have been walking home alone at night! They shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have been a 10-year-old living in Ohio! Women don\u8217\'20\'19t speak up because they know, one way or another, they\u8217\'20\'19ll be punished for it. Just look at Dr Bernard, the source for the Indianapolis Star story: she has had her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/indiana-10-year-old-abortion-ohio-b2124365.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 character attacked}}}\uc2  and Indiana\u8217\'20\'19s attorney general Todd Rokita has even promised to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jul/15/doctor-10-year-old-rape-victim-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investigate her.}}}\uc2  This horrific story is yet another reminder that, even in the most shocking circumstances, the default position in society is to question women\u8217\'20\'19s credibility. I really hope that Kessler takes some time to consider those facts.\par \par \uc2 Republicans block bill on right to travel across state lines for abortions\par \par \uc2 One Republican senator claimed that the proposal would encourage \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2022/jul/14/joe-biden-middle-east-israel-inflation-polling-us-politics-latest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  tourism}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D\u8211\'20\'13 as if women would decide to cancel their trips to the beach and decide to go for a nice, relaxing, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  instead. Republicans are now making it very clear that they are going after the right to free movement.\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Have you recently had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\u8217\'20\'19 Australian transiting through US questioned then deported\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s not clear why customs officials {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2022/jul/13/have-you-recently-had-an-abortion-australian-transiting-through-us-questioned-then-deported"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 asked Madolline Gourley whether she\u8217\'20\'19d had an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ; nor why they thought this was any of their business.\par \par \uc2 Sudanese woman, 20, faces death by public stoning for adultery\par \par \uc2 Most stoning sentences are overturned in high court and the woman has said she is appealing the decision. However, even if it is overturned, the fact that she was sentenced to death by stoning is horrific. It\u8217\'20\'19s the first known case in Sudan {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2022/jul/13/sudan-woman-faces-death-by-stoning-for-adultery-in-first-case-for-a-decade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 for almost a decade}}}\uc2  and a violation of international law; activists worry that the sentence is part of a broader rollback of women\u8217\'20\'19s rights in the country. Adultery obviously takes two: what happened to the man involved? I haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to find any information on that but I can tell you that stoning sentences are predominately given to women.\par \par \uc2 Uber\uc2  sued by 550 women over sexual assaults\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit alleges a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2022/jul/14/uber-faces-550-passenger-lawsuit-over-alleged-and-assault-in-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 systematic failure}}}\uc2  to prevent violence against women on the \uc2 Uber\uc2  platform, caused by \u8220\'20\'1Cthe toxic-male culture at \uc2 Uber\uc2  \u8230\'20\'26 A culture which started at the very top of \uc2 Uber\uc2  by placing profits and growth over safety above all else and, in the process, exploited, endangered, and injured women and girls\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Spain responsible for violence against woman in C-section case\par \par \uc2 A United Nations committee has said an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2022-07-14/spain-responsible-for-violence-against-woman-in-c-section-case-un-body-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unnamed Spanish women}}}\uc2  was subject to \u8220\'20\'1Cobstetric violence\u8221\'20\'1D when she was forced to undergo a caesarean section without her consent with her arms strapped down. Such violence against women in childbirth is widespread and systematic, the \uc2 UN\uc2  body found.\par \par \uc2 More depressing proof that climate crisis is a feminist issue\par \par \uc2 A new study has found that extreme weather events often catalyse episodes of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-022-01903-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gender-based violence}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Questions raised over \u8216\'20\'18Women\u8217\'20\'19s Network\u8217\'20\'19 phallic rebrand\par \par \uc2 Earlier this year the Australian government unveiled (and then quickly withdrew) a new logo for the Prime Minister\u8217\'20\'19s and Cabinet\u8217\'20\'19s Women\u8217\'20\'19s Network which, unfortunately, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2022/mar/15/australian-pms-department-drops-widely-mocked-phallic-womens-network-logo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 looked like a purple penis}}}\uc2 . How did nobody catch this? It\u8217\'20\'19s unclear: newly released documents show that no concerns were raised about the design\u8217\'20\'19s phallic appearance although the government\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cwomen champion\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2022/jul/15/senior-public-servant-questioned-womens-network-rebrand-but-not-phallic-logo-design-documents-show"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 did want to know where the idea came from.}}}\uc2  Don\u8217\'20\'19t we all.\par \par \uc2 The week in paw-triarchy\par \par \uc2 Rowdy, an appropriately-named cat, has spent nearly a month playing hide-and-seek with the staff of Logan International airport in Boston after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2022/jul/14/cat-rowdy-logan-airport-boston-caught"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 escaping from a flight}}}\uc2 . She has finally allowed herself to be found and reunited with her owner. No more cargo flights for Rowdy, I reckon. First class all the way.\par \par \uc2 \u183\'00\'B7 Arwa Mahdawi\u8217\'20\'19s new book, Strong Female Lead, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/ARWAMAHDAWI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 available for order}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220716ei7g001md\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 atleast5(abortion)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Date\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/2021 to 06/30/2026\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-